<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Code-to-model traceability: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Basic docstrings are present for steady-state root finding (L24-62), but functions lack explicit equation, section, and figure mappings to Murray (1981) Eqs. (4)-(16), Section 4 Eqs. (26)-(32) Figs. 9-12, Liu et al. (2006) two-stage rosette equations, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_003_mammalian_coat_markings.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py L24–L91: Docstrings omit explicit equation numbers and Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py#L24-L91>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Model fidelity to source: 52/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes the exact Thomas (1975) / Murray (1981) homogeneous steady state (u0, v0) = (9.9338, 9.2892), Jacobian J0, and unstable wavenumber interval gamma*k^2 in [0.5236, 0.9648] (L24-62), but `simulate_cylinder_eigenmodes` (L65-91) synthesizes patterns using a Gaussian-weighted linear cosine sum rather than numerically integrating the nonlinear Thomas reaction-diffusion PDE du/dt = gamma*f(u,v) + Lap(u), dv/dt = gamma*g(u,v) + d*Lap(v) on a tapered conical cylinder with curvilinear Laplace-Beltrami operator and Neumann boundary conditions, and omits Liu, Liaw & Maini (2006) two-stage spot-to-rosette maturation." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py L65–L91: Linear cosine superposition instead of nonlinear Thomas PDE + curvilinear conical tail Laplace-Beltrami solver <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py#L65-L91>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Morphometric validation: 42/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L112-130) returns only 2 analytical scalar quantities (u0 and gamma*k_c^2) without measuring spatial wavelengths, proximal-vs-distal tail mode anisotropy, negative-control amplitude suppression, or biological specimen rosette spacing CV and nearest-neighbor statistics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py L112–L130: Only 2 analytical measurements returned; no PDE or specimen morphometrics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py#L112-L130>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-thomas-steady-state-substrate-concentration-u0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-measurement-turing-critical-wavenumber-squared-gamma-k-c-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 4.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — MorphoEval overall 47.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py` (overall weighted score: 49.4 / 100). The v1 script solves the homogeneous steady state (u0, v0) = (9.9338, 9.2892) and linear Turing instability band [k_-^2, k_+^2] = [0.5236, 0.9648] of Thomas (1975) / Murray (1981) kinetics, but approximates pattern formation via a heuristic cosine superposition rather than integrating the nonlinear Thomas reaction-diffusion PDE with zero-flux Neumann boundaries on a 2D flank and curvilinear tapered conical tail; omits negative/ablation controls (d = 1 equal diffusion and K = 0 non-inhibitory Michaelis-Menten ablation); does not load or segment the vendored Panthera pardus specimen photograph; and exposes only 2 measurements without dispersion metrics or CLI parameter flags. Overall 47.1/100 (faithfulness 40.1, reproducibility 63.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 52, Morphological realism / specimen match 28, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 42, Source and data traceability 62, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/mammalian_coat_markings_comparison.png: rendered output of 1981-murray-mammalian-coat-markings.py at 8871db0, image/png, 39199 B, 1540×630 px, artifact_sha256 14cc11c7b1fa12eb1a72b65c3c0f413058f5e546252a64d303be9f03a27847b7 (sha256 14cc11c7b1fa12eb1a72b65c3c0f413058f5e546252a64d303be9f03a27847b7), spec_fingerprint 525df88cbbed5362e036470fa7d127c713eb89280f82aab38da743ea194e4397. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 525df88cbbed5362e036470fa7d127c713eb89280f82aab38da743ea194e4397; artifact_sha256: 14cc11c7b1fa12eb1a72b65c3c0f413058f5e546252a64d303be9f03a27847b7; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/mammalian_coat_markings/mammalian_coat_markings_reference.json=6d8170232f54ccce..., datasets/mammalian_coat_markings/panthera_pardus_specimen.jpg=86533a5dcf9cfee6..., datasets/mammalian_coat_markings/scout_manifest.json=28eabc9cf247b03e...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement dual negative/ablation controls around the homogeneous steady state: (1) equal-diffusion control d = Dv/Du = 1.0 < d_c = 9.6292, and (2) non-inhibitory Michaelis-Menten ablation K = 0.0 (testing Lean Theorem 2 where K*u0^2 = 0 < 1 prevents self-activation).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/mammalian_coat_markings/mammalian_coat_markings_reference.json`, `panthera_pardus_specimen.jpg`, and `scout_manifest.json` at runtime; segment the biological leopard flank rosettes and distal tail rings directly from `panthera_pardus_specimen.jpg`; and compare biological vs simulated inter-spot wavelength CV, Voronoi polygonality, and proximal-to-distal tail anisotropy.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the linear cosine superposition with a genuine 2D nonlinear Thomas (1975) / Murray (1981) reaction-diffusion PDE solver (with zero-flux Neumann boundaries) on both a planar mammalian flank domain (including Liu, Liaw & Maini 2006 two-stage spot-to-rosette maturation) and a curvilinear tapered conical cylinder (Laplace-Beltrami operator (1/r) d/dx(r du/dx) + (1/r^2) d^2u/dtheta^2).",
        "remediation needed: Sweep all 5 scale regimes gamma in {0.4, 3.5, 8.0, 25.0, 120.0}, expose full CLI parameters (--a, --b, --alpha, --rho, --K, --d, --gamma, --steps, --seed), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-backed morphometric measurements with uncertainty/control deltas, and upgrade `docs/media/mammalian_coat_markings_comparison.png` and `docs/media/mammalian_coat_markings_growth.gif`." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.71e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-mammalian-coat-markings-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1981) Thomas substrate-inhibition reaction-diffusion pre-pattern & conical tail spot-to-ring transition — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
