    dct:description "Simulates only 2 static gamma values (8.0 and 25.0) in the comparison figure without Murray's full 5-regime scale morphospace sweep (gamma from subcritical 0.4 uniform mouse coat to 120.0 large mammal high-mode crowding), without equal-diffusion (d=1.0) or non-inhibitory (K=0.0) negative controls, and without CLI flags for a, b, alpha, rho, K, d, or gamma (L133-141)." ;
